(100, 1, 3, 13, 'Denmark', 'TV2 Play', 'Gynteren og gongongen', 'The dong and the gong', 'The word \'gynter\' is a slang word in Danish, which can be used to refer to a large nose or penis. The word \'gynteren\', then, is somewhat equivalent to \'the dong\'.'),
