(157, 1, 8, 45, 'Denmark', 'TV2 Play', 'Bønnemøde', 'Bean meeting', 'The Danish word \'bønnemøde\' means \'prayer meeting\'. However, in this context, it appears to be a play on words, as \'bønne\' also means \'bean\', and the English word \'mode\' is a type of mathematical average.'),
