(160, 1, 8, 47, 'Denmark', 'TV2 Play', 'Skål rødmer majestæt to', 'Cheers blush majesty two', 'It\'s unclear why they went with this Danish translation beginning with \'skål\' (\'cheers\'), rather than just using \'tolv\' (\'twelve\').'),
