(198, 1, 10, 67, 'Denmark', 'TV2 Play', '8 km/dag', '8 km/day', 'Metric measurements of distance are standard in mainland Europe, so \'8km/day\' is more appropriate than \'five miles per day\'.'),
(199, 1, 10, 68, 'Finland', 'MTV Katsomo', 'Qipsejä', 'Quisps', '\'Sipsejä\' is the Finnish word for \'crisps\', so they have simply replaced the initial letter with a \'Q\', to emulate the English title.'),
(200, 1, 10, 68, 'Denmark', 'TV2 Play', 'Quhips', 'Quisps', 'The Danish call crisps \'chips\', so \'Quhips\' works better that \'Quisps\'.'),
