(214, 1, 11, 75, 'Sweden', 'SVT Play', 'Teddybjörnen Testarsson', 'Teddy Bear Taskersson', 'Teddybjörnen Testarsson is likely a pun on the famous song, <em>Teddybjörned Fredriksson</em>. The title is a reference to the use of the teddy bears in the \'Fell the coconut, then move the drinks\' task.'),
